licationOpened(fromBackground: false)","","\/\/ ... the process's work ...","","await lifecycle.finish()  \/\/ tracks ApplicationTerminated","await tracker.finish()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The store keeps the version and nothing else. ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore","isActive":true},{"text":" keeps it in a file, by default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"beside a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore"},{"text":"’s records; ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/InMemoryVersionStore","isActive":true},{"text":" keeps it in memory, for tests; any type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of yours can conform. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"kinds:"},{"text":" turns kinds of event off, while the version is still saved.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As the app leaves the foreground, it waits for the tracker’s worker to write every record tracked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so far to the tracker’s store, then calls the store’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"synchronize()"},{"type":"text","text":". A delivery batched with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".lifecycle"},{"type":"text","text":") sends what is pending as it reads the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" record. The notification’s handler only hands the transition on; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"t